+- [x] Update plan checkboxes, commit documentation, and invoke superpowers:finishing-a-development-branch. agent-dev fixes integration choice: push the branch and create a draft PR; no merge/options prompt.
+- [x] Post the Implementation Summary and Cost Summary following `.agents/includes/ticketing.md` and `.agents/includes/cost.md`, using start `2026-10-23T17:35:48Z`; move ticket 1 to `status:review`. Never block delivery on unavailable cost data.
+
+## Execution evidence
+
+- All three implementation tasks completed with failing-first tests; final `dotnet test`: 33 passed, 0 failed. `git diff --check` passed.
+- One independent whole-branch review found no Critical, Important, or Minor issues.
